# Architettura Flutter

| Cartella | Ruolo |
|----------|-------|
| `screens/` | UI per flusso (sotto-cartelle per dominio) |
| `services/` | HTTP, storage, push, deep link |
| `models/` | Parsing JSON |
| `widgets/` | UI riusabile, `design_system/` |
| `config/` | API, Stripe |
| `theme/` | Tema Material |
| `l10n/` | IT, EN, ES, AR, ZH |

## Regole

- Screen → service → model. HTTP solo via `HttpClientService`.
- Navigazione tab: `MainScreen`. Route named in `app.dart`.
- Bootstrap in `main.dart` (Firebase, Stripe, `ErrorReporter`).
- Logging: `utils/app_logger.dart`.

Nuova feature: endpoint backend prima di screen/service Flutter.
